# UI Kit icons & buttons

- Use the shared `Icon` component: `import { Icon } from '@/components/ui-kit/icons'`.
- **Do not pass `className` to `Icon`** (no `h-*`, `w-*`, `mr-*`, colors, etc).
- Icons must use **static sizes only**:
  - ✅ `<Icon name="plus" size="sm" />`
  - ✅ `<Icon name="loader-2" size="sm" animation="spin" />`
  - ❌ `<Icon name="plus" className="h-4 w-4 mr-1" />`

## Buttons

- **Never** put `<Icon />` inside `<Button>…</Button>` just to render a leading icon.
- Use `Button`’s built-in icon props instead:
  - ✅ `<Button iconName="plus">Add</Button>`
  - ✅ `<Button iconName="loader-2" iconAnimation="spin" disabled>Saving</Button>`
  - ❌ `<Button><Icon name="plus" … /> Add</Button>`
  - ❌ `<Button icon={<Icon … />} … />`

## Styling / color

- If an icon needs a different color, apply the text color to the **parent** element (or wrap in a `<span className="...">`) and keep the `Icon` itself classless.
